# ============================================================
# AI Jathagam Generator — .gitignore
# Stack: FastAPI (Python) + Next.js (TypeScript/pnpm) + Swiss Ephemeris
# See AGENTS.md §2 & §3.7, jathagam-architecture.md §2.1 for ephe/LICENSING context
# ============================================================

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 0. Project docs — keep tracked
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NOTE: ephe/*.se1 + sefstars.txt ARE intentionally tracked (see §2).
# Do NOT add ephe/ to gitignore — sub-arcsecond precision requires the
# full JPL DE431/441-derived .se1 files; Moshier mode does not change
# the AGPL vs commercial licensing and trades away accuracy for no gain.
# If you must fetch them locally instead of cloning, uncomment the fetch
# block in jathagam-architecture.md §2.1 then re-track ephe/.

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Python — Backend (FastAPI / PyJHora / pyswisseph)
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Byte-compiled / optimized / DLLs
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
*.pyd

# Distribution / packaging
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
backend/**/lib/
backend/**/lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
share/python-wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
MANIFEST

# Virtual environments
.env
.venv
env/
venv/
ENV/
env.bak/
venv.bak/
.python-version

# PyInstaller
*.manifest
*.spec

# Installer logs
