# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 11. Misc — keep these tracked, listed here as reminders
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# DO track:
#   pnpm-lock.yaml            — reproducible installs
#   ephe/sepl_18.se1 etc.     — precision ephemeris data (few MB, required for correct charts)
#   .claude/skills/**/SKILL.md — domain skill (jathagam-vedic-astrology)
#   .agents/skills/**/SKILL.md
#   README.md, AGENTS.md, jathagam-architecture.md, Sharmela_Jathagam.md
# DO NOT track:
#   jathagam.db, .env, node_modules, .next, .pytest_cache, dist, logs

.venv311/
